Bundled Bible texts (scripture-mcp/data), sourced from scrollmapper/bible_databases:
- Berean Standard Bible (BSB): dedicated to the public domain (CC0) on 30 April 2023. https://berean.bible
- Reina-Valera 1909: public domain.
- Biblia Livre: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Brazil.
- Russian Synodal Translation: public domain.
- Chinese Union Version (Traditional): public domain.
- Ang Biblia (1905): public domain.
- Kinh Thanh Tieng Viet (1934): public domain.

The Nicene Creed (creed/): English translation in the public domain, from onthewing.org via
the Creeds.json dataset (github.com/NonlinearFruit/Creeds.json), presented in its AD 381 form.

Model weights are not included. Recommended models (models/recommended.json) are downloaded by the
user from Hugging Face under their own licences.
